1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,336
Some stories are never written in books.

2
00:00:03,636 --> 00:00:08,052
They live in our homes and pass from one generation to the next.

3
00:00:08,352 --> 00:00:13,536
Our family story is rooted in the historic, beautiful land of North Shewa.

4
00:00:13,836 --> 00:00:17,364
Today, I share my father's story.

5
00:00:17,664 --> 00:00:23,376
Through farming, he demonstrated hard work and became a role model to people around him.

6
00:00:23,676 --> 00:00:28,476
He worked day and night to raise our family with love and good values.

7
00:00:28,776 --> 00:00:33,672
In both farming and community life, he was an example to those around him.

8
00:00:33,972 --> 00:00:39,948
Through customary mediation and reconciliation, he served his community.

9
00:00:40,248 --> 00:00:46,464
Those times were not easy. He taught us to face hardship with patience and perseverance.

10
00:00:46,764 --> 00:00:54,996
Years pass and generations change. The love, diligence and respect we learned from my father live on. Our story is our identity.
